.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-IMPORT-REVIEW 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import\-review \- Review staged shares awaiting promotion
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import review\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Review staged shares awaiting promotion
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-pending(1)
List staged shares awaiting review
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-notify(1)
Report staged shares older than an age threshold to a route
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-rejected(1)
Mark a staged share rejected, with a reason
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-expired(1)
Mark a staged share expired, with a reason
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-reopen(1)
Reopen a rejected or expired staged share
.TP
quipu\-import\-review\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
